       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TMODLABR.
      *REMARKS.    THIS PROGRAM IS CALLED BY TMODEXES (THE MODIFY
      *            EXECUTIVE PROGRAM) TO HANDLE MAINTENANCE AGAINST
      *            THE WORK ORDER LABOR FILE. RECORDS MAY BE ADDED,
      *            DELETED, AND/OR CHANGED.
      *            THE TERMINAL IS USED AS BOTH THE INPUT AND THE
      *            OUTPUT DEVICE. ALL TERMINAL FUNCTIONS ARE
      *            HANDLED BY HP'S VIEW SOFTWARE.
      *C   3/09/93.     M.L. MITCHELL
      *C   REPLACED A SECTION OF CODE IN 64-READ-SCREEN THAT CAUSED
      *C   THE PROGRAM TO BLOWUP WHEN THE USER ENTERED A START DATE
      *C   THAT WAS EQUAL TO SPACES.  THE PROGRAM NOW DISPLAYS AN
      *C   ERROR MESSAGE AND ALLOWS THE USER TO CONTINUE.
      *C   04/18/1995     CA ZUBEK
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO CHECK FOR NUMERIC ITEM NUMBER IN ORDER TO
      *C     PREVENT DATA DECIMAL ERRORS.  ALSO ADDED CHECKS FOR NUMERIC
      *C     DATE AND TIME ON THE CHANGE SCREEN.
      *C
      *C   SEPTEMBER 1996  JE COFFMAN  REQ# 6619
      *C     EXPANDED DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE
      *C
      *C   MAY 2000        JE COFFMAN
      *C     REPAIRED A PROBLEM THAT CROPPED UP AFTER PLANTS MIGRATED
      *C     TO 12 HOUR SHIFTS WITH CHANGING LABOR TIMES.
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.   AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.   AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                      LOCAL-DATA IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZMODIFY-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DSPLY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT PERSONNEL-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS PF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-BASIC-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1001
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WBF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-LABOR-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WLF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-LAST-NUM-USED
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPMM0800
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RELATIVE KEY IS ARG-NUM
               FILE STATUS IS WLNU-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-PLANNED-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1101
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WPF-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSPLY-REC                         PIC X(2000).
       FD  PERSONNEL-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS PERSREC.
       01  PERSREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM0301.
       FD  WO-BASIC-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WBFREC.
       01  WBFREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1001.
       FD  WO-LABOR-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WLFREC.
       01  WLFREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1301.
       FD  WO-LAST-NUM-USED
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WLNUREC.
       01  WLNUREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFPMM0800.
       FD  WO-PLANNED-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WPFREC.
       01  WPFREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1101.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  ARG-NUM                          PIC 9(9).
       77  B-OR-P-SW                        PIC 9.
       77  CHAIN-CTR                        PIC 999.
       77  COTM-MINS                        PIC S9(4).
       77  DATE-SW                          PIC 9 VALUE 0.
       77  ERR-SW                           PIC 9.
       77  MIN-DIFF                         PIC S9(4).
       77  SC-SW                            PIC X.
       77  SHIFT-END                        PIC 9(4).
       77  SHIFT-STRT                       PIC 9(4).
       77  SUB                              PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
       77  SUB1                             PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
       77  SUB2                             PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
       77  STTM-MINS                        PIC S9(4).
       77  TIME-END-COMP                    PIC S9999.
       77  TIME-STRT-COMP                   PIC S9999.
