               MOVE "19"        TO SAVE-CC
           ELSE
           MOVE "20"            TO SAVE-CC.
           MOVE EMPLOYEE-STTM   TO TIME-HOLD.
           MOVE TIME-RECD       TO TIME-SAVE.
           MOVE "S" TO SC-SW.
           PERFORM 62-3-DATE-EDIT THRU 62-3-DT-EXIT.
           IF DATE-SW = 1
               GO TO 62-READ-SCREEN.
           IF DATE-SW = 2
               GO TO 62-READ-SCREEN.
      *--- CHECK FOR NUMERIC MONTH, DAY, AND YEAR.   04/18/1995
           IF E-CODT-MD NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE 35031 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
