      *--- CHECK FOR NUMERIC TIME.      04/18/1995
           IF EMPLOYEE-COTM NOT NUMERIC
               MOVE 46009 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE ERROR-BUFFER TO EDIT-ERROR
               MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (9) INDS (99)
               GO TO 62-READ-SCREEN.
           IF EMP-COTM-MI > 59
               MOVE 35029 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
