           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
           MOVE DATE-DB         TO LCS-COMP-DATE.
           IF LCS-COMP-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19"        TO LCS-COMP-DATE-CC
           ELSE
           MOVE "20"            TO LCS-COMP-DATE-CC.
           MOVE EMPLOYEE-COTM   TO LCS-COMP-TIME.
