           MOVE LBR-CST-CENTS-9 TO E-COST-CENTS.
           IF E-COST-CENTS > 50 ADD 1 TO E-COST-DOLS.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE EMPLOYEE-NUM TO PERCCNUM OF PERSREC.
           START PERSONNEL-FILE KEY IS = EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               INVALID KEY    MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF PF-STATUS NOT = "00" MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF COND-WORD = 17
               MOVE 35047 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE EMPLOYEE-NUM TO CAT-TEXT1A
               MOVE ERROR-BUFFER TO EDIT-ERROR
               MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (17) INDS (99)
               GO TO 64-READ-SCREEN.
           READ PERSONNEL-FILE NEXT INTO PERSONNEL-DATA
               AT END MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF PF-STATUS NOT = "00" MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
       64-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE "FMODLCH2" TO VIEW-CFNAME.
           MOVE 66068 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE ERROR-BUFFER TO REQ-CMD-LINE.
           MOVE EDIT-ERROR TO REQ-ERR-LINE.
