               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE ERROR-BUFFER TO EDIT-ERROR
               MOVE TRUE-VAL TO INDS (5) INDS (99)
               GO TO 64-READ-SCREEN.
           IF EMPLOYEE-SHIFT = "1"
               MOVE S-1 TO SHIFT-STRT
               MOVE E-1 TO SHIFT-END
               IF SHIFT-END < SHIFT-STRT
                   ADD 2400 TO SHIFT-END
               END-IF
           ELSE
           IF EMPLOYEE-SHIFT = "2"
               MOVE S-2 TO SHIFT-STRT
               MOVE E-2 TO SHIFT-END
               IF SHIFT-END < SHIFT-STRT
                   ADD 2400 TO SHIFT-END
               END-IF
           ELSE
